|desc=
When you avoid a melee blow while unarmed, you may throw the target to the ground.

The chance to attempt a throw is {{CL|((5 + 0.05 * Cun) * Talent Level)|100%|0|0|50%|50}}.

If the throw lands, the target will take {{CTPD|5|50}} damage and be dazed for 2 turns, or {{CTPD|10|75}} damage and be stunned for 2 turns if the target is grappled.

The number of throws you may attempt each turn is {{CS|(Str + Dex - 20)|0|0|2.24|180}}.

The chance of a successful throw increases with your Accuracy, the damage scales with your Physical Power, and the number of attempts with your Strength and Dexterity.
}}